\cataloguefield{subsection}{HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED}

HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED: Canonical assurance against a governed subject is not independent review of the assurance service itself.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Process Overview}

Assurance execution evaluates an identifiable subject under an applicable definition and establishes a finding through adjudication where sufficient evidence permits. Correct execution with insufficient evidence remains different from execution failure and from a positive or negative conclusion about the subject. Participating Functions describe responsibilities without supplying unapproved lifecycle states.


\cataloguefield{subsection}{Definition / governed semantic detail}

\begin{itemize}

\item
\textbf{Canonical Name}: \texttt{\seqsplit{Assurance Process Execution}}.



\item
\textbf{Owning Capability}: \href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/02-strategy/capabilities/business-enabling-capabilities.md\#governed-assurance}{Governed Assurance}.



\item
\textbf{Process Purpose}: Performs defined assurance for an identifiable governed subject in accordance with an applicable Assurance Definition and establishes an Assurance Finding /\allowbreak{} Conclusion from applicable trustworthy evidence.



\item
\textbf{Principal Performing Role}: \href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/actors-roles/roles.md\#service-guardian}{Service Guardian}.



\item
\textbf{Participating Functions}: \href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/health-service-assurance.md\#establish-assurance-context}{Establish Assurance Context}, \href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/health-service-assurance.md\#assess-assurance-evidence}{Assess Assurance Evidence} and \href{https://github.com/fhirfactory/harmonia/blob/98410db60155198a75f74c79d98060070209faa1/docs/markdown/03-business-architecture/behaviours/health-service-assurance.md\#adjudicate-assurance-assessment}{Adjudicate Assurance Assessment}, all retaining Governed Assurance ownership.



\item
\textbf{Conceptual Basis and Output}: Applicable Assurance Definition plus identifiable governed subject; Assurance Finding /\allowbreak{} Conclusion established through adjudication where sufficient trustworthy evidence permits. Correct execution with insufficient evidence does not imply satisfaction or non-satisfaction or force a conclusion.



\item
\textbf{Boundary}: Function completion does not define Process lifecycle states. No Context Established, Evidence Assessed, Adjudicated or Concluded states are inferred. Detailed lifecycle states, transitions and initiation mechanics remain unresolved. Requesting this Process does not grant control of evidence assessment, adjudication or the resulting finding/\allowbreak{}conclusion.



\end{itemize}

