\par\textbf{HUMAN ADJUDICATION REQUIRED:} \nameref{cap:bec-service-offering-readiness-coordination} (p.\,\pageref{cap:bec-service-offering-readiness-coordination}). Dependency evidence material retained at the out-of-scope CT1. A proposed determination of collective go/no-go readiness is not inherited as authority by dependency tracking.
